[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16382.99, "timestamp": "04:33:02", "text": "启动器。呃，163，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16386.15, "timestamp": "04:33:06", "text": "163. 嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16395.269, "timestamp": "04:33:15", "text": "这些。我会把这些卖掉。每个人都有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16397.109, "timestamp": "04:33:17", "text": "他们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16399.07, "timestamp": "04:33:19", "text": "这是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16402.949, "timestamp": "04:33:22", "text": "皮肤。它的粪便是一层皮。哇。真是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16405.709, "timestamp": "04:33:25", "text": "姓名。你会。这就是皮肤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16407.869, "timestamp": "04:33:27", "text": "等待。武器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16411.75, "timestamp": "04:33:31", "text": "皮肤。我从来没解锁过任何东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16415.029, "timestamp": "04:33:35", "text": "比如武器之类的东西。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16418.67, "timestamp": "04:33:38", "text": "我该如何检查？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16422.709, "timestamp": "04:33:42", "text": "正确的。我的天哪，这竟然是一坨屎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16425.67, "timestamp": "04:33:45", "text": "这到底是什么鬼东西？它其实是一坨屎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16429.99, "timestamp": "04:33:49", "text": "皮肤。什么？我会坚持我的立场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16433.31, "timestamp": "04:33:53", "text": "坚持我的，我会坚持我的"}]